<title>SPAIN: Spain says Repsol privatisation imminent.</title>
<headline>Spain says Repsol privatisation imminent.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The sale of Spain's remaining 10 percent stake in energy group Repsol will take place very soon, deputy Economy Secretary Fernando Diaz said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;Repsol's privatisation is imminent. We are already at an advanced stage,&quot; he told a news conference.</p>
</text>
